"""Preparation oracle for ``linalg_solve_ex`` (FlagGems operator 964).

This file is the reference-as-solution candidate that the project's own
injection option

    --override linalg_solve_ex:<this file>:run

installs on ``flag_gems.linalg_solve_ex``.  It therefore exposes exactly the
